      "control_id": "CTL.EKS.ENDPOINT.PRIVATE.001",
      "control_name": "EKS Clusters Must Enable Private Endpoint Access",
      "control_description": "EKS clusters must enable private endpoint access so kubectl and API traffic can use a VPC-resolved private endpoint. Without private access, all control plane traffic traverses the public internet, expanding the attack surface and adding an internet dependency for cluster management.\n",
